o and Tiger. I will use my cavalry to hunt any visible enemy riders.\n"},{"seq":543,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c182","house":"kite","letter":"L230","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":3300,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":544,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c183","house":"kite","letter":"L231","kind":"letter","to":"orchid-camp","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2","s-mid","south-village","orchid-camp"],"depart":3600,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":"SQULN"},{"seq":545,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c184","house":"kite","letter":"L232","kind":"decoy","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":3300,"plain":"BOWMEN, ATTACK AT NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":null},{"seq":546,"t":3300,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1859,"retries":0},{"seq":547,"t":3300,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino seems focused on F1 (West Ford) with multiple units reported there. Tiger has units near F2 (South Bank Middle) and F3 (South Bank East). My goal is to secure two fords or take a camp. I will move my cavalry to intercept rhino riders near F1, following doctrine. I'll use ar"},{"seq":548,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c185","house":"orchid","letter":"L233","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":3300,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":549,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c186","house":"orchid","letter":"L234","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":3300,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":550,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c187","house":"orchid","letter":"L235","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":3300,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":551,"t":3300,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1697,"retries":0},{"seq":552,"t":3300,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Rhino has F1, Orchid is threatening F1/S-West. I must react to the Orchid letter attacking S-East and secure F3. Tiger cav is well-placed to exploit any weakness or secure F3."},{"seq":553,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c188","house":"tiger","letter":"L236","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":3300,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK EAST.","cipher":null},{"seq":554,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c189","house":"tiger","letter":"L237","kind":"order","to":"tiger-arch-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":3300,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK EAST.","cipher":null},{"seq":555,"t":3300,"type":"delivered","courier":"c173","letter":"L218","house":"orchid"},{"seq":556,"t":3300,"type":"delivered","courier":"c180","letter":"L228","house":"rhino"},{"seq":557,"t":3300,"type":"delivered","courier":"c182","letter":"L230","house":"kite"},{"seq":558,"t":3300,"type":"delivered","courier":"c185","letter":"L233","house":"orchid"},{"seq":559,"t":3300,"type":"delivered","courier":"c186","letter":"L234","house":"orchid"},{"seq":560,"t":3309,"type":"delivered","courier":"c158","letter":"L196","house":"rhino"},{"seq":561,"t":3315,"type":"delivered","courier":"c160","letter":"L198","house":"kite"},{"seq":562,"t":3315,"type":"delivered","courier":"c162","letter":"L200","house":"kite"},{"seq":563,"t":3329,"type":"delivered","courier":"c149","letter":"L187","house":"kite"},{"seq":564,"t":3338,"type":"clash","a":"tiger-arch-1","b":"orchid-inf-1","x":185,"y":653},{"seq":565,"t":3349,"type":"delivered","courier":"c169","letter":"L207","house":"tiger"},{"seq":566,"t":3392,"type":"delivered","courier":"c155","letter":"L193","house":"orchid"},{"seq":567,"t":3399,"type":"delivered","courier":"c126","letter":"L157","house":"kite"},{"seq":568,"t":3401,"type":"delivered","courier":"c170","letter":"L208","house":"rhino"},{"seq":569,"t":3416,"type":"delivered","courier":"c172","letter":"L215","house":"kite"},{"se